<title>HUNGARY: Fotex H1 IAS net income HUF 390 mln.</title>
<headline>Fotex H1 IAS net income HUF 390 mln.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six-month period ending June 30.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of forints unless stated)</p>
<p>				    Jan-June 1997   Jan-June 1996</p>
<p>    Group operating profit	 608	vs     198</p>
<p>Group profit before</p>
<p>     minority interest and tax   612	vs     237</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit	   535	vs     224</p>
<p>    Group net income		 390	vs     184</p>
<p>    Group sales		   17,674	vs  15,594</p>
<p>    Cost of sales		 11,257	vs  10,134</p>
<p>    Gross profit		   6,417	vs   5,460</p>
<p>Selling, general and</p>
<p>     administrative costs	5,809	vs   5,262</p>
<p>    Net other income		   3 profit  vs     0</p>
<p>    Net financial income	     6 profit  vs     5 loss</p>
<p>    Net extraordinary income	 1 loss    vs    44 profit</p>
<p>    Minorities			  77	   vs    13</p>
<p>    Taxation			   145	   vs    40</p>
<p>NOTE - Fotex Rt is a retailer chain. The figures are unaudited, consolidated and were calculated in accordance with International Accounting Standards.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
